      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Pretty sure this a known issue as you can get stuck in multiple parts of menu usage. Here is a related link which has been marked as under review: https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/stuck-after-showing-you-are-in-and-back-twice\n\n-----\n\nAll similarly reported issues can be found:\n- https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/unable-to-move-after-adding-world-to-favourites-list\n\n- https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/stuck-after-some-time-in-the-menu\n\n- https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/cannot-use-portals-quick-menu-or-avatar-selection\n\n-https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/double-clicking-on-show-avatar-author-completely-breaks-player-movement",
