  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This has been tested and is reproducible on desktop and VR. VR users can easily go to the settings menu and close VRChat unlike desktop users who have to use ALT + F4 to close the game. This can be produced in any world you go to.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n1. Go to the world menu\n2. Select any world\n3. Press the back button as the world menu will show up again\n4. Close the menu and try moving forwards, backwards, and turn 360 on controllers and keyboard",
